  "description": "The Redline PL 26 is a new take on a classic BMX cruiser bike. Built to really be ridden, this bike features updated geometry along with retro styling. A full chromoly steel Redline frame and fork are lightweight, but strong. Double wall rims with aluminum hubs give you a wheelset that can be ridden all day. The Redline PL 26 comes with a flip-flop hub in case you want to put a smaller rear cog on the bike. Hop on the PL 26 and explore the city, cruise the neighborhood, or hit the track for a few laps.",
